WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.032
Module 14 brings the course together.

00:00:03.032 --> 00:00:06.222
It is important to be clear about one thing.

00:00:06.222 --> 00:00:12.187
Module 14 is a course synthesis and a sample data-preparation walkthrough.

00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:15.862
It is not the official final-project assignment.

00:00:15.862 --> 00:00:23.880
The actual project instructions, rubric, due date, required files, and submission details are in Canvas.

00:00:24.345 --> 00:00:28.982
In Module 14, we will connect the major habits from the entire course.

00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:38.397
We will start with source meaning and grain, then move through profiling, cleaning, integration, reshaping, validation,

00:00:38.397 --> 00:00:40.027
reusable outputs, and documentation.

00:00:40.027 --> 00:00:49.167
Spark adds one more perspective to that workflow: sometimes the same data-preparation ideas need to operate at a much

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:53.977
larger scale. But the core standard does not change.

00:00:53.977 --> 00:01:02.179
Understand the data, make deliberate transformations, validate what you produce, and be able to explain your decisions.
